  "title": "Peanut Butter Cookies with Truvia® Baking Blend",
  "description": "These classic peanut butter cookies are tender, fulfilling and simple to make. Made with Truvia® Baking Blend, these cookies have 70% less sugar* than the full sugar version.",
  "authors": [
